{"linkset":[{"anchor":"/.well-known/api-catalog","item":[{"description":"Map, vector and data tiles of the WMS layers following OGC API - Tiles, with Mapbox GL styles following OGC API - Styles.","href":"/tiles","title":"SmartMet OGC API - Tiles"},{"description":"The RESTful interface of the Web Map Tile Service (WMTS 1.0.0) of the WMS layers. The capabilities document lists the layers, styles, tile matrix sets and dimensions.","href":"/wmts","title":"SmartMet WMTS"}]},{"anchor":"/tiles","service-desc":[{"href":"/tiles/api","title":"SmartMet OGC API - Tiles - OpenAPI definition","type":"application/vnd.oai.openapi+json;version=3.1"}],"service-doc":[{"href":"/tiles/api/docs","title":"SmartMet OGC API - Tiles - API documentation","type":"text/html"}]},{"anchor":"/wmts","service-desc":[{"href":"/wmts/api","title":"SmartMet WMTS - OpenAPI definition","type":"application/vnd.oai.openapi+json;version=3.1"}],"service-doc":[{"href":"/wmts/api/docs","title":"SmartMet WMTS - API documentation","type":"text/html"}]}]}